               <p xml:id="idm135">Chr. Richardt wrote a vast number of texts to pictures by well known painters and draughtsmen, many of them for children's books. In 1879 he compiled and grouped them in "Billedtexter, gamle og nye med sex og halvtredsindstyve Træsnit". "Fuglekvidder" was inspired by a drawing by O.A. Hermansen (1849-97).</p>
